            "code_snippet": "  }\n  if (inv.tasks) {\n    add(\"Task completion\", \"available\",\n      `${inv.tasks} TaskCreate todo lists in ~/.claude/tasks \u2014 add a todo ` +\n      \"completion-rate stat (done vs abandoned per session).\");\n  }\n  if (inv.file_history) {",
